\title{Transport on cubical cochains}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{A vertex connection compares values at the ends of an edge.
For an edge or square coefficient, the comparison also depends
on where its value is based and which path carries it. The
cellular torus supplies the labeled cells for these choices.}

